<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><LanguageData><Raven_Hediff_SuppositoryEffect_Immunity.label>免疫型栓剂吸收中</Raven_Hediff_SuppositoryEffect_Immunity.label><Raven_Hediff_SuppositoryEffect_Immunity.description>渡鸦族特制栓剂正在体内缓慢溶解。药物成分正在持续修复受损组织并增强免疫系统。\n\n由于给药方式和药物的特殊性，会导致下体异物感和轻微的意识模糊。</Raven_Hediff_SuppositoryEffect_Immunity.description><Raven_Hediff_SuppositoryEffect_Emergency.label>应急型栓剂吸收中</Raven_Hediff_SuppositoryEffect_Emergency.label><Raven_Hediff_SuppositoryEffect_Emergency.description>栓剂正在减缓失血并强行维持意识，但会明显拖慢行动。</Raven_Hediff_SuppositoryEffect_Emergency.description></LanguageData>